Revision: 4fbcbd0ad380cc232890e563bcabfec0ad313faa
License: Proprietary. The upstream README labels this software proprietary and forbids unauthorized copying/modification/distribution/reverse engineering. The platform owner states written permission for this multi-merchant integration; deployment/distribution must remain within that authorization. No Shopee source has been deobfuscated or modified.

Install production dependencies with npm ci --omit=dev --ignore-scripts. package.json files remain upstream originals; package-lock.json files have compatible security updates for Axios/Express and their transitive dependencies. Upstream .env.example files contain apparent credentials and are deliberately excluded. Managed children receive only per-wallet configuration generated by the platform.

The managed preload is platform-owned integration code outside either original source. It forces all child listeners to IPv4 loopback and an OS-assigned port and provides a private IPC bridge to GoPay's exported refreshSession function. Gateway programs are unofficial and are not endorsed by the wallet providers.

The platform validates the real upstream QR payload and exact invoice amount. ShopeePay leaves tag 01 at 11 after inserting tag 54; the adapter changes that initiation marker to 12 and recalculates CRC without changing account, merchant, or amount fields. The proprietary ShopeePay program itself is unmodified.
